{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cattopia is a momentum-based 2D platformer where you swing with a fishing line grapple to navigate branching paths, unlock different endings by helping Catto\u2019s friends, and create custom levels with a powerful in-game editor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305690/extras/afb0e0eae68dcb2352c40b81fb93bbac.poster.avif?t=1772390825\" width=960 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305690/extras/afb0e0eae68dcb2352c40b81fb93bbac.webm?t=1772390825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade:</strong> Unlock levels and endings through challenging but replayable runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Practice:</strong> Refine level clear times and watch saved replays of your best records</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journal:</strong> Track detailed level progress, records, and stats across multiple categories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing:</strong> Find and catch a variety of fish hidden throughout the levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minigames:</strong> Clear additional levels that introduce unique challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Art Gallery:</strong>\u00a0Freely view illustrations and listen to music after unlocking them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Editor:</strong> Create your own sets of interconnected custom levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization:</strong> Personalize Catto by changing fishing line and lure colors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Leaderboards:</strong> Compete with the community and rise up the leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Workshop:</strong> Share your own custom levels and play others made by the community</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305690/extras/85d4b1e449c6b0f3063ff9c914baf5f2.webp?t=1772390825\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305690/extras/85d4b1e449c6b0f3063ff9c914baf5f2.poster.avif?t=1772390825\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1010 height=305 /></picture></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3305690?t=1772390825","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305690/2546eacd410328f237e7a5643f544559b2d38a18/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772390825","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305690/8b9d043a006a3a0c8cb565015fd0ddf83d293043/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772390825","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305690/8b9d043a006a3a0c8cb565015fd0ddf83d293043/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772390825","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4291790,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cattopia is a momentum-based 2D platformer where you swing with a fis